[00:00.43] And the good Lord said
[00:04.24] Love thy brother than thyself and
[00:06.63] Everything will be made possible to you
[00:12.29] Because he can surely turn the tides
[00:22.29] He can push the tempest by
[01:52.49] And all he asked
[01:54.66] Of men and men and men and men
[01:58.66] Is that we give each other love
